        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11919327731092437,
        "y0": 0.7534192399049882,
        "x1": 0.8811042016806722,
        "y1": 0.7797992874109264
      },
      "text": "Deﬁnition 2.5. An (r × c,v)-near triple array is a binary (near) equireplicate r × c row-column design on v symbols in which",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.13895798319327732,
        "y0": 0.7900106888361045,
        "x1": 0.608181512605042,
        "y1": 0.8050380047505938
      },
      "text": "1. any row and column have either λ−rc or λ+rc common symbols,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.13895798319327732,
        "y0": 0.8136686460807601,
        "x1": 0.5571563025210083,
        "y1": 0.8286959619952494
      },
      "text": "2. any two rows have either λ−rr or λ+rr common symbols,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "list",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.13895798319327732,
        "y0": 0.8373266033254156,
        "x1": 0.5807529411764706,
        "y1": 0.852353919239905
      },
      "text": "3. any two columns have either λ−cc or λ+cc common symbols.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11919327731092437,
        "y0": 0.8625866983372922,
        "x1": 0.8815327731092436,
        "y1": 0.9027790973871734
      },
      "text": "Note that the deﬁnition allows a near triple array to be equireplicate. To avoid having to calculate the quantities involved in the deﬁnition explicitly, it will often be convenient to instead use the following alternative characterization of near triple arrays.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
